  choices = $EXPL$["Availability only","Processing integrity only","Security (common criteria)","Privacy only"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AT-C Section 205 and the AICPA Trust Services Criteria (TSC 2017), the security category (common criteria CC1–CC9) is mandatory in every SOC 2 engagement. It serves as the foundation upon which all other optional categories are built.
Wrong (A): Availability is an optional category selected based on the service organization''s commitments to user entities regarding uptime and system performance.
Wrong (B): Processing integrity is optional and applies only when the entity commits to the completeness and accuracy of system processing.
Wrong (D): Privacy is optional and selected when the entity collects or processes personal information subject to privacy commitments.$EXPL$
