Wrong (A): Stock price history is not relevant to understanding the service organization''s system or control environment for a SOC engagement.
Wrong (B): A financial statement audit is a separate engagement. SOC engagements focus on the service organization''s system and controls, not its financial reporting.
Wrong (D): Customer satisfaction surveys do not provide the technical understanding of system controls, infrastructure, and procedures required for SOC engagement planning.$EXPL$
WHERE id = 3773;

-- Q3775: SOC Engagements [medium/L1]
