  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Per the AICPA Trust Services Criteria (2017), CC9 (Risk Mitigation) addresses how the entity identifies, selects, and develops activities to mitigate risks, including vendor management programs, insurance, and business continuity planning. CC9 also encompasses managing risks from business partner relationships.
Wrong (A): Monitoring and evaluating internal controls falls under CC4 (Monitoring Activities), which governs ongoing assessments and separate evaluations of the control environment.
Wrong (B): Recruiting and training employees relates to CC1 (Control Environment), which addresses the entity''s commitment to competence and human resource standards.
